<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES OF AMERICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The United States of America is known for its diverse cultural landscape and innovative spirit, serving as the birthplace of Cherries Wild."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHERRIES WILD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cherries Wild is a game show that combines cutting-edge technology with traditional game show charm, reflecting the innovative spirit of the United States."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WILD WEST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Wild West represents the pioneering spirit of the United States, contributing to the show's roots."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SILICON VALLEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Silicon Valley symbolizes technological advancements in the United States, influencing the show's use of advanced technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JASON BIGGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jason Biggs, a host with a diverse heritage, brings a distinctly American flavor to Cherries Wild."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LENA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lena is the charismatic host of the Croatian version of Cherries Wild, embodying the show's charm and energy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IVAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ivan, a charming co-host, adds to the engaging atmosphere during the Croatian Cherry Festival."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ivan, a charming co-host, adds to the show's engaging atmosphere during the Croatian Cherry Festival."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPLIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Split is the setting for the Croatian Cherry Festival, where the show 'Cherries Wild' is celebrated."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADRIATIC SEA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Adriatic Sea provides the backdrop for the Croatian Cherry Festival, adding to the festive atmosphere."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CROATIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Croatia is the setting for the Croatian version of Cherries Wild, showcasing its rich cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ana, a proud Croat, is the creator of the Croatian version of Cherries Wild, dedicated to celebrating her homeland."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRADITIONAL DALMATIAN DELICACIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Traditional Dalmatian Delicacies are featured in the show, representing Croatia's culinary heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEKE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Peke, a traditional Dalmatian dish, is part of the show's challenges, highlighting Croatian cuisine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PAPRIKA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Paprika is another traditional ingredient used in the show's challenges, showcasing Croatian culinary traditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARASCA CHERRIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marasca Cherries serve as the grand prize, symbolizing the show's connection to Croatia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRADITIONAL FOLK DANCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Traditional Folk Dances are included in the show's challenges, reflecting Croatia's cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMERICAN INNOVATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"American Innovation is a key theme of the show, reflecting the United States' commitment to pushing the boundaries of technology and creativity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CULTURAL LANDSCAPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cultural Landscape refers to the diverse cultural heritage of the United States, which influences the show's design and content."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TECHNOLOGICAL ADVANCEMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Technological Advancements represent the cutting-edge technology incorporated into the show, reflecting the United States' leadership in innovation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENTERTAINMENT INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Entertainment Industry is the domain in which Jason Biggs operates, providing him with the skills and experience to host Cherries Wild."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GAME SHOW CHARM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Game Show Charm is a key element of the show's appeal, combining traditional game show elements with modern technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CULTURAL DIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cultural Diversity is reflected in the show's hosts and challenges, showcasing the rich cultural heritage of both the United States and Croatia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CULINARY TRADITIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Culinary Traditions are highlighted through the show's challenges and prizes, emphasizing the importance of food culture in both countries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOLKLORE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Folklore is represented through traditional folk dances and other cultural elements, enriching the show's narrative."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEXT EPISODE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The next episode is an upcoming event or installment in a series, suggesting planning and preparation are underway."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GEAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gear refers to equipment or tools used for the next episode."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Plans refer to the actions taken to prepare for the next episode."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0295</data>
    </node>
